{"id":1600,"root":"وضن","bw":"wDn","tr":"w-ḍ-n","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وَضِينٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>A girth</em> (<span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بِطَان</span>) <em>wide, woven of thongs or hair,</em> or <em>only of skin;</em> (M, K;) <em>said to be adapted for the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رَحْل</span> <em>and the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هَودَج</span>; the <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بِطَان</span> being peculiarly for the <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَتَب</span>: (M:) or <em>it is for the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هَودَج</span>, <em>like the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بِطَان</span> <em>for the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَتَب</span> <em>and the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَصْدِير</span> <em>for the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رَحْل</span> <em>and the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حِزَام</span> <em>for the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَرْج</span>; and <em>both</em> [but to what this refers is doubtful] <em>are like the</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نِسْع</span>, <em>except that they are of thongs woven one upon another, doubly</em> or <em>more.</em> (S.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِيضَنَةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>i. q.</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُفَّةٌ</span> i. e. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَرْجُونَةٌ</span>. (TA in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضون</span>.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars"